mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","Official gameplay image from Kiro’s learn-by-playing guide.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/spirit-of-kiro.webp","alt","Spirit of Kiro workshop gameplay with a ghost beside the item lever and crafting workbench.","https://kiro.dev/docs/guides/learn-by-playing/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[92],"Kiro","创作者开发记录",[97],"evidence","section",{"_61":98,"_25":99,"_100":101},"阅读官方 Kiro 开发说明","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro#spirit-of-kiro","note","Official creator statement reports more than 95% prompted code. The core crafting loop is complete; roadmap features and intentionally unfinished challenge-branch tasks remain separate.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[106],{"_61":107,"_25":108,"_100":109},"查看完整合成游戏项目","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro","MIT-0 game repository with Vue client, Bun server, item-image service, infrastructure, and deployment documentation. Runtime item text and interactions depend on AWS Bedrock; item-image generation has additional optional model requirements.","获取方式","download","demo","试玩与运行",[115],{"_61":116,"_25":117,"_100":118},"Download and run Spirit of Kiro","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No anonymous hosted game is linked by the official project. Local play requires Docker/Podman, an AWS account/credentials and CLI, Bedrock access to supported text models, and deployed Cognito resources. Follow docs/local-setup.md to launch the stack and bootstrap DynamoDB. AWS runtime usage can incur charges; source-checked steps, not executed.","游戏平台","源码下载","指南形式","教程","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[126],{"_61":127,"_25":81,"_100":-7},"跟随官方边玩边学指南","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[132,133,134,135],"Read the official setup guide and confirm the AWS model access required for the runtime.","Deploy the Cognito resources, start the client/server stack, and bootstrap the local DynamoDB tables.","Play the discover, craft, and sell loop before attempting the challenge branch.","Follow one guided bug fix or feature change and verify the resulting interaction in the game.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Kiro 官方项目说明超过 95% 的代码通过提示 Kiro 编写。配套指南使用这个实际游戏讲解引导文件、修复、重构、规格、钩子与 MCP；游戏运行时也用 AI 生成物品及合成结果。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Custom Vue 3 · DOM/CSS sprites · TypeScript","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[132,133,134,135],{"_61":165,"_25":81,"_17":123},{"_61":116,"_25":117,"_17":111,"_100":118},{"_61":162,"_25":108,"_163":164,"_100":109},{"_61":161,"_25":99,"_100":101},"resourceIds",[],"Read the official Kiro development disclosure","Open the complete crafting-game project","scope","complete-project","Follow the official learn-by-playing guide",{"_167":168},"documents",{"_73":169,"_35":170},[172,176,177,178,175,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,174,211,173,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232],[171,172,173,174,175],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","c